Package: blockmodels
Type: Package
Title: Latent and Stochastic Block Model Estimation by a 'V-EM'
        Algorithm
Version: 1.2.1
Date: 2026-11-06
Description: Latent and Stochastic Block Model estimation by a Variational EM algorithm.
             Various probability distribution are provided (Bernoulli,
             Poisson...), with or without covariates. See Leger (2016)
             <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1602.07587>.
License: LGPL-2.1
Depends: R (>= 3.4.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Imports: 
    Rcpp,
    parallel, 
    methods, 
    digest
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://grosssbm.github.io/blockmodels/, https://github.com/GrossSBM/blockmodels
BugReports: https://github.com/GrossSBM/blockmodels/issues
